    "title": "Internship with Tybee Cottages Inc.",
    "description": "The internship is a project to create an affordable digital signage solution for Tybee Cottages Inc. The project will include acquiring a backend software to remotely control stations to be placed within each rental. In addition, hardware will be selected for each station. i.e., thin client, arm based clients, etc... Each station will connect to the main television located within each unit. They will display relevant information for guest during their stay, and alert guest in the event of a natural disaster or other emergency situations. In addition, if time allows the student may be asked to write scripts to scrape, via php and MySQL, our availability calendars for updates.",
